abstract: "Three open CSV datasets modeling finalized 2026/27 New Zealand IRD income tax brackets, the 3.5% default KiwiSaver rate and 1.75% ACC Earner's Levy, employer ESCT rate cliffs, and exact year-end refund math across 10 secondary-tax scenarios."
